# Rebuild after changes

After changing this extension, rebuild and install it before finishing:

```bash
npm run install-cursor
```

Run that from the repo root. It compiles TypeScript and copies the extension to `~/.cursor/extensions/local.active-0.1.0`. Tell the user to reload Cursor when the install finishes.

Do this after every change that affects the extension, including source, `package.json`, and other files the install script copies. Skip it when the only edit is this rule or another file the extension does not load.
